      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "WAN: **vlan10** · LAN: **vlan20** · Trunk: **enp1s0**. NUC/probes every **15 seconds**, AP snapshots every **30 seconds**; history up to **30 days / 2 GB**.\n\nWi-Fi traffic and clients cover the main SSIDs; retry/failure counters cover each radio. RSSI/noise are measured at the AP. Failed or stale AP samples leave gaps; they are not zero traffic or signal. AP SSH can remain unavailable until its recovery schedule fires after a reboot. Panels are provisioned from Git."
